speechtext:
Mr. Speaker, I would like to propose a resolution in the House that has been discussed by all sides of the House, seconded by the hon. member for Stormont-Dundas:
Whereas the game of hockey is part of the Canadian identity and mindful of the fact that the National Hockey League is considering expansion;
And whereas this House is of the opinion that any future expansion of the NHL would benefit from the inclusion of Canadian teams;
Therefore, that this House supports the efforts of Ottawa and Hamilton in their bids to obtain National Hockey League franchises.
